# Infect (CR 702.90): damage from a source with it is dealt to a creature as -1/-1 counters and to a player as poison
# counters, never as marked damage or lost life. Blightsteel Colossus (11/11 trample, infect) is cast on turn 3 with
# three Black Lotuses, Sol Ring and a Mox, and attacks on turn 5 into a Guerrilla Gorilla that blocks it. Trample
# assigns the Gorilla lethal damage - two - and the other nine to Bot2: two -1/-1 counters kill the Gorilla and nine
# poison counters are one short of losing (CR 704.5c: ten do), while Bot2's life is untouched. The Gorilla's own two
# damage is ordinary damage and is marked on the indestructible Colossus.

